Hanuman asks why brothers entered the fearful forest --- Lakshmana names Rama eldest son of Dasharatha --- Lakshmana tells exile with Sita and her rakshasa theft --- Lakshmana cites Kabandha pointing to Sugriva --- Lakshmana says both brothers seek Sugriva refuge --- Hanuman tells exiled wronged Sugriva will help search --- Hanuman bears glad brothers toward the monkey king
